{"id": "1548218088691077120", "channel_id": "1548218088691077120", "author_id": "443666528282345472", "author_name": "cheepqieep", "content": "I want to start building teams for D-Zone, but not sure who would go where...\nI also have 7 standard unit selector things + timeloop and prototype horizon unused, again haven't used them because I'm not sure who to invest in\nThanks in advance!", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T06:25:56.845000+00:00", "thread_id": "1548218088691077120", "attachments": [{"id": "1548218089164771368", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-09-12_161611.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1086068, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1548218088691077120/1548218089164771368/Screenshot_2026-09-12_161611.png?ex=6aa641f4&is=6aa4f074&hm=c50e70a190be3ec66931719d935233c75ffc2cd40ac1c34993b53bbdbf918768&"}, {"id": "1548218089559167017", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-09-12_161617.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1122627, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1548218088691077120/1548218089559167017/Screenshot_2026-09-12_161617.png?ex=6aa641f5&is=6aa4f075&hm=b12fad03a5308dcf1beb807620a2a219d3f741faa5d7af61dc09f911766a5998&"}, {"id": "1548218089970335834", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-09-12_161626.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 602635, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1548218088691077120/1548218089970335834/Screenshot_2026-09-12_161626.png?ex=6aa641f5&is=6aa4f075&hm=c5c18af2c5a1d24d272b0165b1d2d94d730c315aaad33112da692c79fd6563c7&"}, {"id": "1548218090452684821", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-09-12_161800.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 863914, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1548218088691077120/1548218090452684821/Screenshot_2026-09-12_161800.png?ex=6aa641f5&is=6aa4f075&hm=31cae36c0f154d56116d2996688e05c114e9d0efda6a9d90ec7ccc2c3c40b7da&"}], "thread_title": "Team Building + Pulling Advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1548237353900839023", "channel_id": "1548218088691077120", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there <:Saya_yum:1513124263291387975> \n\nThe first level of each wave is quite accessible, so here's my advice :\n- Choose 4 awakeners you love\n- Place your weakest one in a the first empty team\n- Add another awakener you like ( not one of the 4 )\n- Fill the blanks in a way that makes sense for you\n- Repeat 3 times\n- Create a backbone for the 5th team to be completed with a borrowed lvl 90 awakener\n\n\nThere will obviously be improvement to be made and synergies to find out. But just getting there will let you get a better feel of what works or not.", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T07:42:30.029000+00:00", "thread_id": "1548218088691077120", "thread_title": "Team Building + Pulling Advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1548237833389473926", "channel_id": "1548218088691077120", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Also, D-tides requires that you understand who your face.\nGo there, fail and learn : pattterns, shortcommings and strengths, keywords, damage output, debuffs ... once you find out why you lose, you can plan a comeback.\n\nOf course, we will be happy to help if a specific boss proves too much to handle <:Saya_foto:1513124059334971402>", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T07:44:24.348000+00:00", "thread_id": "1548218088691077120", "thread_title": "Team Building + Pulling Advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
